{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_019iE18syndTv4ikyGR3iJSu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! The booking is confirmed. Now I need to provide the final summary (STEP 4) with all the relevant information.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**STEP 4: Booking Complete! ✅**\n\n---\n\n### 🎉 Flight Booking Confirmation\n\n**Confirmation Number:** ABC123XYZ\n\n**Flight Details:**\n- **Flight:** AF1234 - Air France\n- **Route:** New York (JFK) → Paris (CDG)\n- **Date:** June 15, 2024\n- **Departure:** 09:00\n- **Arrival:** 22:30\n- **Class:** Economy\n- **Seat:** 12A (Window)\n- **Total Price:** €350\n\n**Passenger Information:**\n- **Name:** John Smith\n- **Email:** john.smith@example.com\n\n**Destination Information:**\n- **Weather in Paris:** Sunny, 18°C, humidity 65%, light breeze from west\n- **Current Time in Paris:** 14:30 CET (UTC+1)\n\n---\n\n📧 A confirmation email has been sent to john.smith@example.com\n\nHave a wonderful flight to Paris! The weather looks perfect for your arrival. ☀️"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13,"cache_creation_input_tokens":293,"cache_read_input_tokens":2163,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":293,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":285,"service_tier":"standard"}}